/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Master Material: M_Guardrail_Galvanized_Master
Asset Path: /Game/Materials/Barriers/M_Guardrail_Galvanized_Master
Target Use: Outer highway W-beam steel guardrails, posts, spacers, terminal ends

PBR SPECIFICATION & PARAMETER REGISTRY:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. BASE COLOR (Albedo):
   - Param "Zinc_BaseColor" (LinearColor, Default=(0.76, 0.78, 0.80, 1.0)):
     Hot-dip galvanized zinc metal tone.
   - Param "Zinc_Spangle_Scale" (Scalar, Default=35.0):
     Micro crystalline flower pattern typical of hot-dip galvanization.
   - Param "Rust_Streak_Tint" (LinearColor, Default=(0.48, 0.22, 0.10, 1.0)):
     Oxidation around bolt holes and seams.

2. METALLIC & ROUGHNESS:
   - Param "Metallic_Value" (Scalar, Default=0.95): True galvanized metal.
   - Param "Roughness_Base" (Scalar, Default=0.28): Zinc surface sheen.
   - Param "Roughness_Weathered" (Scalar, Default=0.55): Weathered oxidation areas.
   - Param "Rust_Metallic" (Scalar, Default=0.0): Rust is dielectric.

3. DELINEATOR REFLECTORS (Cat-eyes):
   - Param "bHasCatEyeReflector" (StaticSwitch, Default=False):
   - Param "CatEyeColor" (LinearColor, Default=(1.0, 0.15, 0.05, 1.0)): Red for outer shoulder, Amber for median.
   - Param "RetroreflectiveStrength" (Scalar, Default=5.0): Headlight reflection.
================================================================================
*/
